### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/health

### =========================================================================
### 1. LIVE CLASSES CRUD
### =========================================================================

### Crear Clase en Directo
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/live-classes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "liveName": "Conexión Cuántica y Meditación en Vivo",
  "liveUrl": "https://zoom.us/j/123456789"
}

### Obtener todas las Clases
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/live-classes

### Obtener Clase por ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/live-classes/1

### Actualizar Clase
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/live-classes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "liveName": "Conexión Cuántica - Sesión Especial",
  "liveUrl": "https://youtube.com/live/ejemplo123"
}

### Eliminar Clase
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/live-classes/1

